# ============================================================================
# CONCEPTUAL QUESTIONS (Q1-Q7)
# ============================================================================

# Q1: For any constant c, E[c] equals c ✓
# Q2: If X and Y are independent, Cov(X, Y) equals 0 ✓
# Q3: Correlation Cor(X, Y) always lies between -1 and 1 ✓
# Q4: Variance of X equals E[X^2] - (E[X])^2 ✓
# Q5: Correlation is unitless and always between -1 and 1 ✓
# Q6: E[Y | X = x] is the average of Y among observations with X = x ✓
# Q7: If X and Y independent, Var(X + Y) equals Var(X) + Var(Y) ✓

